{
  "info": {
    "name": "abd-ecomm-nestjs",
    "description": "Shopify na upar aapno API layer.\n\nUSE KARVANI RIT:\n1. `Auth / 1. Request OTP` chalavo — devCode apne-aap save thai jashe\n2. `Auth / 2. Verify OTP` chalavo — code apne-aap bharaay chhe, ane accessToken + refreshToken save thai jaay chhe\n3. Have baaki na badha requests sidha chale chhe — Bearer token apne-aap lagi jaay chhe\n\nBadha tokens collection variables ma save thay chhe, etle manually copy-paste karvanu nathi.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001/api/v1" },
    { "key": "identifier", "value": "9876543210" },
    { "key": "linkIdentifier", "value": "juno-email@example.com" },
    { "key": "productHandle", "value": "peach-traditional-paithani-dupatta" },
    { "key": "devCode", "value": "" },
    { "key": "linkDevCode", "value": "" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "nextCursor", "value": "" },
    { "key": "addressId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] },
        "description": "Postgres, Redis ane Shopify config nu status."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Request OTP",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.devCode) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('devCode', res.devCode);",
                  "  console.log('OTP saved:', res.devCode);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('destination masked chhe', () => pm.expect(res.sentTo).to.include('*'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"{{identifier}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/request",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "otp", "request"]
            },
            "description": "Phone ya email — banne aa ek j field ma.\n\nResponse hammesha ek j hoy chhe, user exist kare ke na kare (enumeration proof).\n\nDev ma `devCode` ma OTP aave chhe ane e apne-aap next request mate save thai jaay chhe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Verify OTP (login)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.tokens) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.tokens.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.tokens.refreshToken);",
                  "  console.log('Tokens saved. isNewUser =', res.isNewUser);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"{{identifier}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{devCode}}\",\n  \"deviceId\": \"postman\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "otp", "verify"]
            },
            "description": "OTP verify => login.\n\nAlag signup endpoint nathi: navo user hoy to ahiya j bane chhe, ane juno (Shopify no) hoy to eno existing record ACTIVE thai jaay chhe — enu badhu history sathe.\n\nTokens apne-aap save thai jaay chhe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Me (profile)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Profile + badha verified email/phone.\n\n`emailVerified: false` hoy to app \"Verify your email to see older orders\" batavi shake."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Update profile (screen 05)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Abhay\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Desai\",\n  \"email\": \"abhay@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Registration screen. Login pachhi `isNewUser: true` aave tyare j app aa screen dekhaade.\n\n⚠️ Ahiya no email VERIFIED NATHI — fakt contact mate save thay chhe (`contactEmail`). Profile ma `emailVerified: false` j rahese.\n\nJuna orders sathe match karva mate user e e email `Identity linking` folder na endpoints thi verify karvo padse."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Refresh token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.refreshToken);",
                  "  console.log('Tokens rotated');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\",\n  \"deviceId\": \"postman\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "token", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Har refresh e juno token revoke thay ane navo bane chhe (rotation).\n\nJo koi juno token fari vapre, to e chori no signal chhe — tyare aakhi family revoke thai jaay chhe ane fari login karvu pade."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Logout (aa device)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Logout everywhere",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout-all",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout-all"]
            },
            "description": "Badha devices par thi logout."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Identity linking",
      "description": "\"Juna orders nathi dekhata?\" flow.\n\nUser e phone thi login karyu, pan website par na juna orders guest checkout ma ALAG email thi hata. E email ahiya verify kare etle e orders ena account sathe jodai jaay chhe.\n\nSecurity: fakt VERIFIED identifier par j match thay chhe — nahi to bija na orders leak thai jaay.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Request OTP for other email/phone",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.devCode) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('linkDevCode', res.devCode);",
                  "  console.log('Link OTP saved:', res.devCode);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"{{linkIdentifier}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/identities/request-otp",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "identities", "request-otp"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Verify & link",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"{{linkIdentifier}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{linkDevCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/identities/verify",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "identities", "verify"]
            },
            "description": "Verify safal thay etle j — ane tya sudhi nahi — aa identifier na Shopify records jodaay chhe.\n\nResponse ma `linkedShopifyRecords` batave chhe ke ketla juna records jodaaya."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Addresses",
      "description": "Badha endpoints par login jaruri chhe.\n\nAddresses aapda Postgres ma chhe, Shopify ma nahi — etle migration vakhte addresses sathe aavse, Shopify par pacha javu nahi pade.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. List",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["addresses"]
            },
            "description": "Default address hammesha sauthi upar aave chhe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Create",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('addressId', res.id);",
                  "  console.log('addressId saved:', res.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Abhay\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Desai\",\n  \"phone\": \"+919876543210\",\n  \"line1\": \"A-101, Shanti Nagar\",\n  \"line2\": \"Near Bus Stop\",\n  \"city\": \"Ahmedabad\",\n  \"province\": \"Gujarat\",\n  \"provinceCode\": \"GJ\",\n  \"zip\": \"380015\",\n  \"country\": \"India\",\n  \"countryCode\": \"IN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["addresses"]
            },
            "description": "Pehlo address apne-aap default bane chhe.\n\nDedupe: e j address fari moklo (bhale alag casing/spacing ma) to navo NATHI banto — ejj update thay chhe. \"A-101, Shanti Nagar\" ane \"a 101 shanti nagar\" ek j ganay chhe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Update",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"line2\": \"Opp. Garden\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["addresses", "{{addressId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Partial update — je fields moklya nathi e ejj rahe chhe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Set default",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}/default",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["addresses", "{{addressId}}", "default"]
            },
            "description": "Ek j address default rahe chhe — juno apne-aap hati jaay chhe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Import from past orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses/import-from-orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["addresses", "import-from-orders"]
            },
            "description": "\"Fetch my shipping addresses based on past order\" checkbox nu endpoint.\n\nApp ne aa login PACHHI call karvanu (verify na response ma nahi) — jethi Shopify dhimu hoy to pan login atke nahi.\n\nFAKT verified phone/email na orders jovaay chhe. Ek j address 15 orders ma hoy to pan ek j vaar save thay chhe.\n\n⚠️ `read_all_orders` scope vagar Shopify fakt CHHELLA 60 DIVAS na orders aape chhe. Response ma `limitedToRecentOrders: true` aa j batave chhe. Juna grahak na varso juna orders e scope approve thay pachhi j malse."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Delete",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["addresses", "{{addressId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Default address delete karo to bijo koi apne-aap default banii jaay chhe."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Products",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.nextCursor) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('nextCursor', res.nextCursor);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Shopify shapes leak nathi', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('gid://');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?limit=20&sort=newest",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20", "description": "1-50" },
                {
                  "key": "sort",
                  "value": "newest",
                  "description": "newest | oldest | title | updated | relevance"
                },
                { "key": "search", "value": "paithani", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "tag", "value": "Silk Dupattas", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "type", "value": "Dupatta", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "vendor", "value": "Look & Book", "disabled": true },
                {
                  "key": "cursor",
                  "value": "{{nextCursor}}",
                  "description": "Aagli page — apne-aap save thay chhe",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cursor-based pagination (page numbers nahi).\n\nNote: price sort nathi — Shopify na Admin API ma products connection par price no sort key j nathi. Phase 2 ma Postgres thi aavse."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List — next page",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?limit=20&sort=newest&cursor={{nextCursor}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "sort", "value": "newest" },
                { "key": "cursor", "value": "{{nextCursor}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Pehla `List` chalavo — nextCursor apne-aap save thai jashe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?limit=10&search=paithani",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" },
                { "key": "search", "value": "paithani" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products/{{productHandle}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{productHandle}}"]
            },
            "description": "`:id` = product no handle/slug.\n\nShopify na numeric ids app sudhi kyarey nathi jata — handle aapdo potano data chhe ane Phase 2 ma pan e j rahese."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
